<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηλ-άτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
		fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηλ-άτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ:
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς,
			ἐλαύνω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one that drives away oxen, cattle-lifter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.176
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ox-driving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάβδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.200
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
			</span></i>); <i>ox-tormenting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύωψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					307
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cattle-driver</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				7.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				261d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1177.112
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. διθύραμβος</span> the dithyramb
				<i>which gains a bull for the prize</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.19
			</span></i>.</div>
